  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "K.Jahir Usain vs The Commissioner on 3 September, 2024 Author: N.Sathish Kumar Bench: N.Sathish Kumar W.P(MD)No Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 03.09.2024 Coram : The Honourable Mr.Justice N.Sathish Kumar W.P(MD)No.20985 of 2024 K.Jahir Usain ... Pet Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Food Safety, Drugs Administration, No.359, Annasalai, Teynampet, Chennai. 2.The District Collector, Madurai District, Madurai. 3.The Designated Officer, Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Food Safety Wing, Viswanathapuram, Madurai District. 4.The Food Safety Officer, Madurai Corporation, Madurai. 5.The Inspector of Police, Perungudi Police Station, Madurai District. ... Resp Prayer: Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of Ind praying this Court to issue a Writ of Mandamus, directing the respondent 3 and 4 to unseal the petitioner's small tiffin shop situated at Valaiya https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/6 K.Jahir Usain vs The Commissioner on 3 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/167667210/ 1 Pass Road, Thriuparankundram Taluk, Madurai-625 022, based on the petitioner's representation dated 29.07.2024. For Petitioner : Mr.B.Chakkaravarthi For R1 & R2 : Mr.D.Gandhiraj, Special Government Plead For R3 & R4 : Mr.A.Kannan, Additional Government Pl For R5 : Mr.M.Vaikkam Karunanith Government Advocate (Crl Order",
    "facts": "In such circumstances, on 29.06.2024, the 5th respondent Police arrested the petitioner, stating that they got an information from one Ansari, who had supplied some tobacco products to the p e t i t i o n e r a n d r e g i s t e r e d a c a s e i n C r i m e N o . 1 1 9 o f 2 0 2 4 f o r t h e o f f e n c e s https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis punishable under Sections 6(b), 24(1) of Cigarette and other Tobacco Products Act, 2003 and Section 328 IPC, against the petitioner. Pursuant to which, he was in judicial custody for 20 days and thereafter, released on bail. Therefore, the petitioner approached the 2nd respondent, requesting to de-seal the shop. Since no action has been taken, the petitioner has filed this Writ Petition.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
